<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE - San Bernardino Cty, Calif., agency.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE - San Bernardino Cty, Calif., agency.</headline>
<text>
<p>SAN BERNARDINO COUNTY TRANSPORTATION AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $60,035,000</p>
<p>SALES TAX REVENUE BONDS (LIMITED TAX BONDS)</p>
<p>1996 SERIES A</p>
<p>Effective at 12:00 Noon E.S.T., Friday, November 15, 1996 all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>Artemis Capital Group, Inc.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
